# Package Audit — MeApp monorepo

Date: 2026-09-15
Scope: root + `apps/client`, `apps/server`, `packages/db`, `packages/shared`
Method: static import analysis (ripgrep over all `.ts`/`.tsx`/`.js`, excluding `node_modules`, `dist`, `.expo`, `drizzle`), installed-manifest peer inspection, `bun audit`, npm registry lookups, and `bun test` / `tsc` / `biome check`.

Follow-up work applied after the first pass: the legacy Fastify tree was removed and its 11 REST endpoints were ported to Elysia (see §8, §11).

