## 7. Peer violations — resolved

Before: `@elysiajs/cors@1.4.2` needed `elysia >= 1.4.0` and `@elysiajs/jwt@1.4.2` needed `elysia >= 1.4.27`, against an exact pin of `elysia@1.3.3`. This was not cosmetic — it crashed the server at boot (§5 of the earlier report; now fixed). `elysia` is at `^1.4.30`, satisfying both.

